    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Grimes are thrilled to present to the market 16 Summerville, a warm and welcoming 2 bed mid-terrace townhouse, in this highly sought after location. The property has a wonderful sense of space as one walks through, and while in need of modernisation, has been lovingly maintained over the years. This fine property is within walking distance of all the amenities Clontarf has to offer and only 2 minutes’ walk from Clontarf Promenade.  \r\n\r\nBuilt in 1993, this light filled accommodation extends to approx. 78 sq m / 739 sq ft and comprises in brief of an entrance hall, living room and, kitchen all downstairs. While upstairs there are 2 spacious double bedrooms and a bathroom. There is a private low maintenance rear garden and a driveway with off-street parking to the front.  \r\n\r\nThe location of Summerville is second to none. Clontarf promenade and cycle track, and Clontarf village and its various boutiques and restaurants are within walking distance. Eastpoint Business Park, the IFSC and Clontarf DART station are just a short distance away.  There is a superb choice of both primary and secondary schools in the vicinity. The area is serviced by excellent transport links to the City Centre and beyond, with a quality bus corridor on the Clontarf Road. The M50 and Dublin Airport are also within a short drive."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall: \r\nSpacious and welcoming entrance hall with alarm panel and storage press \r\n\r\nLiving Room / Dining Room: \r\nBright room overlooking the rear of the property with laminate flooring, complete with gas fireplace with feature surround and patio door to rear.  \r\n\r\nKitchen: \r\nBright, extended kitchen to the front of the property with floor and floor units. Oven, hob, extractor fan, washing machine and dishwasher \r\n\r\nBedroom 1: \r\nLarge double bedroom overlooking the rear with built-in wardrobes, laminate flooring and Velux window \r\n\r\nBedroom 2: \r\nLarge double bedroom overlooking the front with laminate flooring and built-in presses \r\n\r\nBathroom: \r\nPart tiled with WC, Velux, wash hand basin with storage and bath with electric shower attachment \r\n\r\nAttic: \r\nFloored for storage \r\n\r\nOutside:  \r\nTo the front is a driveway with off-street parking and to the rear is a private walled garden laid in lawn. \r\n\r\nServices:\r\nGas Fired Central Heating \r\nDouble glazed windows \r\nOff-street parking \r\nAlarm \r\n\r\nBER Details:\r\nBER: C \r\nBER No.: 100455070  \r\n\r\nContents:\r\nIncluded - carpets, blinds, light fittings, appliances and all standard fixtures and fittings. Furniture"
      },
